          "@type": "HowToDirection",
          "text": "Mix your grout per the package instructions and apply it with the grout float, working diagonally across the mosaic, then wipe away any excess with a damp sponge. Once it dries, seal the grout to protect it from moisture — unless you used epoxy grout, which is already non-porous and needs no sealing."
