        {
          "@type": "HowToTip",
          "text": "Grout is optional for indoor, dry installations — but essential for exterior, pool and wet areas, where it seals the joints and protects the mosaic from moisture. Choose a light grout for light-toned designs and a dark grout for darker ones, so the joints blend naturally."
